    title: 'Subcontract Welding Agreement: 15 Clauses to Settle Before the Order',
    meta: 'What belongs in a subcontract welding agreement? Scope and revision, material supply, EXC and ISO 5817 requirements, ITP and hold points, tolerances, surface treatment, Incoterms, lead time, nonconformity costs, fixture ownership, confidentiality and steel price adjustment.',
